  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Harrisburg University of Science and Technology (HU), founded in 2001, is a private university located in Harrisburg, Pennsylvania. Recognised for its focus on science, technology, and applied research, HU is one of the leading institutions in the region for STEM education and innovation.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Harrisburg University offers you a dynamic student experience. You can engage with like-minded peers through various student organisations, clubs, and extracurricular activities.</p><p>The University also offers you services for mental health and wellness services, personal counselling, stress management workshops, and various support resources to ensure your well-being.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Harrisburg University offers housing options for undergraduate students through various partners. The housing consists of fully furnished apartment suites with all basic amenities.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>Harrisburg University has a modern, well-equipped library, with quiet study areas, computer stations, and digital resources like online journals, e-books, and academic databases.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>HU offers several sports groups and clubs, including basketball, dodgeball, flag football, soccer, and volleyball.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>HU houses specialised labs and cutting-edge facilities in fields. Some facilities include the Aquaponics Research Lab, Center for Advanced Agriculture and Sustainability, Center for Advanced Entertainment and Learning Technologies, Data Analytics Institute, and many more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
